<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-TW">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>α 老師的動畫教學天地</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: "Microsoft JhengHei", sans-serif; background-color: #f0f2f5; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; padding: 50px 20px; }
        h1 { color: #333; margin-bottom: 40px; text-align: center; font-size: 2em; }
        .menu-container { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; gap: 30px; width: 100%; max-width: 800px; }
        .category-card {
            background-color: #fff;
            width: 250px;
            padding: 30px 20px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 15px;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            transition: transform 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;
            border-top: 5px solid #007bff;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
        }
        .category-card:hover { transform: translateY(-5px); box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.15); }
        .icon { font-size: 3em; margin-bottom: 15px; }
        .title { color: #333; font-size: 1.4em; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .desc { color: #666; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.5; }
        
        /* 替不同的卡片加上不同顏色 */
        .card-motion { border-top-color: #ff6b6b; }
        .card-waves { border-top-color: #4ecdc4; }
        .card-optics { border-top-color: #ffe66d; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <h1>α 老師的動畫教學天地</h1>

    <div class="menu-container">
        
        <a href="motion.html" class="category-card card-motion">
            <div class="icon">🏎️</div>
            <div class="title">運動與力</div>
        </a>

        <a href="waves.html" class="category-card card-waves">
            <div class="icon">🌊</div>
            <div class="title">波動</div>
        </a>

        <a href="optics.html" class="category-card card-optics">
            <div class="icon">🔦</div>
            <div class="title">光學</div>
        </a>

    </div>

</body>
</html>
